efly describe the design choices that prevent inadvertent data leakage: no telemetry by default, no caching of inputs, log scrubbing, clear instructions for users to anonymize upstream or run in a controlled environment."},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Mitigation"},"validations":{"changed":true,"value":[]},"valueType":{"changed":true,"value":"TextQuestionValueType"}},"createdAt":"2026-05-10T21:56:49Z","entityUuid":"8b4d40a6-3be6-40b5-8219-b3f4431a4c40","parentUuid":"01ca2df0-f2e3-4615-ac62-c7b9db656bd2","uuid":"4d1085d2-1ef2-4fb4-a430-1893c2da1089"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":true,"value":[]},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":true,"value":[]},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":true,"value":"a664ce2c-83b0-411a-bdf5-4f829a4ecc25"},"tagUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["b3e257d2-eaaf-4d22-89c9-3024eb7f2f3e","92650c80-a463-4b49-869e-d6cfa63fe564","f137aaf2-c1a7-429b-b498-2c80eb9f2a7d"]},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Physical address"},"validations":{"changed":true,"value":[]},"valueType":{"changed":true,"value":"StringQuestionValueType"}},"createdAt":"2026-05-10T21:56:50Z","entityUuid":"8da73f65-e7ff-4c9f-b32d-6477ecab88e7","parentUuid":"a4cb241a-5f76-4850-b783-d62bb36db4cd","uuid":"5fc8fb7f-e3af-4ee0-9c57-eb48b2f7fc3b"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["98569a9f-cf37-4451-9d20-4836b8187578","b3df6c02-d8b5-48c8-8097-510cb155e85e"]},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":true,"value":[]},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["7fe7d479-b5a0-4ae1-9769-9535f577047e"]},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":true,"value":"de478e18-2a3e-4349-804c-f1d8974897b1"},"tagUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["b3e257d2-eaaf-4d22-89c9-3024eb7f2f3e"]},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Does the software face operational security obligations: authentication, authorization, input sanitization, secret management, vulnerability scanning?\n\nThese usually apply to services, APIs, and daemons. Pure libraries, scripts, and notebooks normally do not face these obligations directly."},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Security & access control"}},"createdAt":"2026-05-10T21:56:51Z","entityUuid":"8eb03e74-d9d9-49ca-9f7f-4d15c8b85874","parentUuid":"93c0dcb5-0d56-44af-8b2d-10c4fbef13ef","uuid":"99291977-2cdb-41e0-90ca-738398b389e2"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["f4cf03cd-6b28-41a5-b1ee-0e510f9c51e5","d9f66fa4-4d0e-4ed8-9786-68dfa63dc8a5","1bdedd35-a682-4dcc-a0e4-ad47ddcea0f8"]},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":true,"value":[]},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["f5a3cdad-9a8f-4c60-9616-bff84465b3cc"]},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":true,"value":"fd08c186-34f3-4104-8715-702e8623393c"},"tagUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["b3e257d2-eaaf-4d22-89c9-3024eb7f2f3e","92650c80-a463-4b49-869e-d6cfa63fe564"]},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Do you check if your dependencies' licenses are compatible with your project's license?\n\nLicense compatibility means the licenses of your project and its dependencies don't conflict legally. It matters when you use third-party code, such as libraries or modules, because incompatible licenses can block you from distributing your software, force you to adopt more restrictive terms, or even introduce legal risk.\n\nTooling: licensecheck / pip-licenses (Python), cargo-deny (Rust), license-checker (Node), FOSSA / Snyk / GitHub Advanced Security (cross-language)."},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"License compatibility"}},"createdAt":"2026-05-10T21:56:52Z","entityUuid":"8fe87903-df9b-4e85-8f80-471a46e20e59","parentUuid":"ce2b567a-da20-43be-a121-e677415a8e0c","uuid":"ae233b6b-d742-4e26-bc03-9b9498beaac2"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":true,"value"