37aaf2-c1a7-429b-b498-2c80eb9f2a7d"]},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Does this software handle personal or otherwise sensitive data?\n\n- **Yes** if your code reads, stores, transmits or processes such data as part of its normal operation (e.g., a Castor extraction script, a clinical-decision-support API).\n- **User-supplied only** if your code is a generic library/CLI/tool that can be used with personal data when the user feeds it that data, but does not handle such data itself (e.g., a statistical analysis library, a plotting tool).\n- **No** if neither applies (e.g., a synthetic-data tool, a build-tool plugin).\n\n"},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Personal / sensitive data handled"}},"createdAt":"2026-05-10T21:56:57Z","entityUuid":"9ffa6c58-87eb-41cc-b161-39501bf4a4a3","parentUuid":"93c0dcb5-0d56-44af-8b2d-10c4fbef13ef","uuid":"0676c04f-6cdb-4c18-8586-ef08f6c2ede6"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"choiceUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["903056b0-5823-4cbc-82b2-d36e7ba8b8e1","13e38f0b-285e-44f7-8996-1665308102d2","5a814e06-13b4-442d-99a3-6655653a9eed","86b038e5-7f76-4d08-b0e6-74cf9d57bf73","440261b5-163b-4ee9-8cf4-a56951044dd3","8a4ae39d-01eb-48ee-9efc-da6624b134e3","d8b511b7-4f6c-49d4-9251-e46fe163a87b","6efbf21e-699a-4797-b341-2121e1f73e94","a54b33b9-b916-481e-910e-218b98ae9674","4b76c87f-de63-492d-b406-a29773bfc9b0","4f2b63c4-5f8b-4baf-b12e-5ebed86b0e47","570d7037-5df8-41a3-b2fe-51c40d530b3b","7215ee7e-bf97-4f97-8124-7cfaa656d6a8"]},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":true,"value":[]},"questionType":"MultiChoiceQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":true,"value":[]},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":true,"value":"de478e18-2a3e-4349-804c-f1d8974897b1"},"tagUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["b3e257d2-eaaf-4d22-89c9-3024eb7f2f3e"]},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"What security measures protect the software and its data?"},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Security measures"}},"createdAt":"2026-05-10T21:56:58Z","entityUuid":"a0bba8ec-69